From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 03:21:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(prx): expand intake-source.ts module doc comment
 (GH-270)

Extend the existing top-of-file JSDoc on
packages/prx/src/intake/intake-source.ts so it covers what #270 asks
for and names every export:

- the verb is runnable by a human (CLI) or an agent invoking the same
  command, and the pin is signed either way (GH-292; missing key is a
  hard refusal)
- an Exports list: intakeSourceOptionsSchema / IntakeSourceOptions,
  IntakeSourceDeps, IntakeSourceError, runIntakeSource

Adds an empty changeset (.changeset/gh270-intake-source-doc-comment.md)
to satisfy changeset-check for a docs-only change under packages/.

Comment-only; the transpiled output is byte-identical to main.

Refs #270

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CVjvRP7P9oSiX3uhjK1xsz
