 .changeset/gh270-intake-source-doc-comment.md |  6 ++++++
 packages/prx/src/intake/intake-source.ts      | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 24 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .changeset/gh270-intake-source-doc-comment.md

