new file mode 100644
index 0000000..862eaf1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/gh270-intake-source-doc-comment.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+---
+
+Docs-only: expand the top-of-file module doc comment on
+`packages/prx/src/intake/intake-source.ts` (#270). No package codepath
+changes, so this changeset is empty.
diff --git a/packages/prx/src/intake/intake-source.ts b/packages/prx/src/intake/intake-source.ts
index 3a32500..ce7125f 100644
--- a/packages/prx/src/intake/intake-source.ts
+++ b/packages/prx/src/intake/intake-source.ts
@@ -13,6 +13,24 @@
  * Sits upstream of the parity chain (the chain root), so it emits no XState
  * event here — it produces the content-addressed artifact the rest of the
  * pipeline reads.
+ *
+ * Runnable by a human or an agent: the verb (`prx intake source`, wired from
+ * `../pr-state/cli.ts`) serves an operator at the CLI and an agent invoking the
+ * same command on the pipeline's behalf. Either way the pin is SIGNED (GH-292):
+ * the submitting actor must hold a signing key, and a missing key is a hard
+ * refusal.
+ *
+ * Exports (GH-270):
+ * - `intakeSourceOptionsSchema` / `IntakeSourceOptions` — zod schema for the
+ *   verb's options: `id` (the work unit) and `format` (`plain` | `json`).
+ * - `IntakeSourceDeps` — injectable `loadIdentity`, `buildResolver`,
+ *   `pinSource`, `signer` and `repoPath`, so tests can run offline (with a dev
+ *   key or an injected signer).
+ * - `IntakeSourceError` — scout's `ScoutSourceError` re-wrapped under this
+ *   verb's surface; anything else propagates untouched.
+ * - `runIntakeSource(options, output, deps)` — delegate the fetch to scout,
+ *   pin the signed result, print `pinned <ref>` (or JSON), and resolve to the
+ *   process exit code `0`.
  */
 
 import { z } from "zod";
